ital, True Lease, Structured Lease, and Vendor Programs. The Financial Lease/Capital is a full payout lease which is used to finance the purchase of different kinds of assets. The True Lease is primarily designed for businesses that want the lowest monthly payment with the greatest flexibility at the end of the lease term. The Structured Lease is based on the nature of the underlying asset. The Vendor Programs is a specialized finance program for vendors whereby lessor finances the vendors' clients according to a mutually agreed legal framework. The company was founded on October 9, 2006 and is headquartered in Giza, Egypt."]}, "initFinancialsQuotes": {"fundamental_currency_code": "EGP", "fiscal_period_fy_h": [2025, 2024, 2023, 2022, 2021, 2020, 2019, 2018, 2017, 2016, 2015, 2014, 2013], "fiscal_period_fq_h": ["2026-Q1", "2025-Q1", "2024-Q4", "2024-Q3", "2024-Q2", "2024-Q1", "2023-Q2", "2023-Q1", "2021-Q4", "2021-Q3", "2021-Q2", "2021-Q1", "2020-Q4", "2020-Q3", "2020-Q2", "2020-Q1", "2019-Q4", "2019-Q3", "2019-Q2", "2019-Q1", "2018-Q4", "2018-Q3", "2018-Q2", "2018-Q1"], "fiscal_period_fh_h": []}, "fundViewMode": "industrial", "initialPeriod": "FY"}